              "help": {
                "text": "The transitive package **`protobufjs@7.6.2`** (via `@opentelemetry/sdk-node` → `@grpc/proto-loader`) is affected by CVE-2026-54269: a name collision with a runtime identifier in generated protobuf code causes denial of service. Fixed in `7.6.3` / `8.6.0`.\n\nName collision with a runtime identifier in generated protobuf code triggers DoS in the OTLP gRPC exporter. Low availability impact.\n\nResolve `protobufjs@>=7.6.5` (covers both CVE-2026-59877 and this) via `@opentelemetry` bump or `pnpm.overrides: { \"protobufjs@7 <7.6.5\": \"^7.6.5\" }`. Regenerate lockfile, verify.",
                "markdown": "The transitive package **`protobufjs@7.6.2`** (via `@opentelemetry/sdk-node` → `@grpc/proto-loader`) is affected by CVE-2026-54269: a name collision with a runtime identifier in generated protobuf code causes denial of service. Fixed in `7.6.3` / `8.6.0`.\n\nName collision with a runtime identifier in generated protobuf code triggers DoS in the OTLP gRPC exporter. Low availability impact.\n\nResolve `protobufjs@>=7.6.5` (covers both CVE-2026-59877 and this) via `@opentelemetry` bump or `pnpm.overrides: { \"protobufjs@7 <7.6.5\": \"^7.6.5\" }`. Regenerate lockfile, verify."
