            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-3449",
              "name": "CVE-2026-3449 in @tootallnate/once 2.0.0 via duckdb (DoS — incorrect control flow scoping)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-3449 in @tootallnate/once 2.0.0 via duckdb (DoS — incorrect control flow scoping)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The transitive package **`@tootallnate/once@2.0.0`** (via `duckdb`'s `node-gyp` > `make-fetch-happen` > `http-proxy-agent`) is affected by CVE-2026-3449: incorrect control-flow scoping causes denial of service. Fixed in `2.0.1` / `3.0.1`."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The transitive package **`@tootallnate/once@2.0.0`** (via `duckdb`'s `node-gyp` > `make-fetch-happen` > `http-proxy-agent`) is affected by CVE-2026-3449: incorrect control-flow scoping causes denial of service. Fixed in `2.0.1` / `3.0.1`.\n\nControl-flow scoping bug in the `once` wrapper causes process DoS in the duckdb build toolchain path. Low severity, local/high-complexity.\n\n`pnpm.overrides: { \"@tootallnate/once@<2.0.1\": \"^2.0.1\" }`, `pnpm install`, verify with `trivy fs pnpm-lock.yaml`.",
                "markdown": "The transitive package **`@tootallnate/once@2.0.0`** (via `duckdb`'s `node-gyp` > `make-fetch-happen` > `http-proxy-agent`) is affected by CVE-2026-3449: incorrect control-flow scoping causes denial of service. Fixed in `2.0.1` / `3.0.1`.\n\nControl-flow scoping bug in the `once` wrapper causes process DoS in the duckdb build toolchain path. Low severity, local/high-complexity.\n\n`pnpm.overrides: { \"@tootallnate/once@<2.0.1\": \"^2.0.1\" }`, `pnpm install`, verify with `trivy fs pnpm-lock.yaml`."
              },
              "properties": {
