          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-41907 in uuid 13.0.0 (OOB write in v3/v5/v6 with caller-provided buffer)\n\nThe direct dependency **`uuid@13.0.0`** (pinned via `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml`) is affected by CVE-2026-41907: `v3`, `v5`, and `v6` accept an external output buffer + offset but do not reject out-of-range writes (small `buf` or large `offset`), allowing silent partial writes into caller-provided memory. Fixed in `14.0.0` (also patched at `11.1.1`, `12.0.1`, `13.0.1`). References include upstream fix commits `uuidjs/uuid@32389c8` and `@3d2c5b0`."
