                "fixed_version": "0.6.0",
                "reachability": "not_imported",
                "reachability_evidence": "No import of `adm-zip`/`AdmZip` exists in application code or scripts. `rg -n -e \"AdmZip\" -e \"adm_zip\" -e \"admZip\" -e \"require\\(['\\\"]adm-zip|from ['\\\"]adm-zip\"` over `--type ts --type js` (excluding node_modules, dist, maps) returned only matches inside `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, and `ops/sbom/sbom-*.json` inventory — no code. The app does ZIP work via the system `unzip` binary instead (src/services/zipUploadService.ts:43,58 use `execFileAsync('unzip', ...)`). This does NOT prove safety (dynamic require/reflection could still load it) but no static import was found."
