          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-33036 in fast-xml-parser 5.4.1 via @aws-sdk/client-s3 (XXE-style entity-expansion DoS, bypass of prior fix)\n\nThe transitive package **`fast-xml-parser@5.4.1`** (pinned via `pnpm-lock.yaml` through `@aws-sdk/client-s3`) is affected by CVE-2026-33036: numeric character references (`&#NNN;`, `&#xHH;`) and standard XML entities completely evade the entity-expansion limits (`maxTotalExpansions`, `maxExpandedLength`) added to fix the earlier CVE-2026-26278, re-enabling entity-expansion (billion-laughs) denial of service. Fixed in `5.5.6` / `4.5.5`. The package is also already pinned under a project `pnpm.overrides` rule (`fast-xml-parser@<5.4.1: 5.4.1`), showing the team actively manages this package."
          },
