            "text": "CVE-2026-41650 in fast-xml-parser 5.4.1 via @aws-sdk/client-s3 (XML injection via improper comment/CDATA escaping)\n\nThe transitive package **`fast-xml-parser@5.4.1`** (pinned via `pnpm-lock.yaml` through `@aws-sdk/client-s3`) is affected by CVE-2026-41650: improper escaping of XML comments and CDATA sections enables XML injection — attacker-controlled values serialized by the parser/builder can break out of their intended context and inject arbitrary XML structure into the generated document. Fixed in `5.7.0`."
