          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Unauthenticated Prometheus metrics endpoints leak operational and object-type data\n\nThree Prometheus scrape endpoints — `GET /api/metrics`, `GET /api/v1/pipelines/metrics`, and `GET /api/v1/funnel/metrics` — are reachable without authentication and expose operational internals: egress-guard block reasons, connection-pool gauges, per-route RED latency series, queue depths, lag and failure counters, and high-cardinality labels that name production object types (e.g. `QaRwBkLoanApplications`). The code assumes network isolation that does not exist in this deployment."
