                "dependency_path": "express@4.22.1 > body-parser@1.20.4",
                "reachability": "imported",
                "reachability_evidence": "`body-parser` is not imported directly in src, but it is the JSON/urlencoded parser used internally by `express@4.22.1` — express itself is the direct dependency imported pervasively in src/server.ts, route files. Whether the app relies on an invalid `limit` value was not confirmed. Affected-symbol check was not performed."
              }
            }
          }
