          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-8723 in qs 6.14.2 via express (TypeError DoS in stringify with comma arrayFormat)\n\nThe transitive package **`qs@6.14.2`** (pinned via `pnpm-lock.yaml` through `express`) is affected by CVE-2026-8723: `qs.stringify` throws a synchronous `TypeError` when called with `arrayFormat: 'comma'` and `encodeValuesOnly: true` on an array containing `null`/`undefined` — the comma + encodeValuesOnly branch maps through a raw encode of the null value. Not guarded by `skipNulls`/`strictNullHandling`. Causes an uncaught exception / process-level DoS when this code path is hit. Fixed in `6.15.2`."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
