              "remediation_steps": "Bump `express` to a release whose `qs` dependency floor is `>=6.15.2`, or `pnpm.overrides: { \"qs@<6.15.2\": \"^6.15.2\" }`. Regenerate lockfile, verify with `trivy fs pnpm-lock.yaml`.",
